## Install

```
sudo shirudo bpm install conformal/@PACKAGE@@1.0.0
sudo shirudo upatch map @SLUG@ @MAP@   # counters: refused, audited, exempted
```

Signed defaults (`config.list`): `mode=enforce` (or `audit`), `exempt_uid=<uid>`
(up to 16). Other settings need a package signed with your own key.

